{%- comment -%}
  The ask-a-human card. It IS Shopify's contact form, not a proxy to one.

  THE ROUTE HERE WAS EARNED. The card first built its own UI and posted its own
  payload to /contact with exactly the fields the contact page emits. Shopify
  returned 400. Posting a hand-built form inside a hidden iframe: 400. Filling
  in a real {% form %}-rendered form and calling .submit() on it from script:
  Shopify navigated to a page titled, in as many words, "Missing CAPTCHA token".

  That is the whole answer. Shopify issues the token when a human interacts
  with a form Shopify rendered, and a scripted submit never gets one. No amount
  of correct fields, correct encoding or correct endpoint substitutes for it.

  So the customer edits and submits the real form themselves. The Somm's draft
  is prefilled into its real fields; everything below the eyebrow is Shopify's
  markup wearing the site's clothes. It ships with no new credential and no
  separate deliverability path, which is what the plan asked for, and it cannot
  send anything the customer has not read — which is what the plan required.

  Hidden by attribute on the wrapper and revealed by somm.js. The FORM is in
  the DOM from page load either way, so Shopify's own script binds to it before
  anyone asks a question.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="non-ask" data-non-ask-card hidden>
  <div class="non-mono non-eyebrow non-ask__head">{{ 'sections.somm.ask_head' | t }}</div>
  <p class="non-ask__why">{{ 'sections.somm.ask_why' | t }}</p>

  {%- form 'contact', id: 'non-ask-form', class: 'non-ask__form' -%}
    {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
      <p class="non-ask__msg">{{ 'sections.somm.ask_sent' | t }}</p>
    {%- else -%}
      {%- if form.errors -%}
        <p class="non-ask__msg non-ask__msg--bad">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        The name is not asked for. It says where the message came from so the
        inbox can tell a Somm escalation from a contact-page enquiry.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[name]" value="NON Somm" data-non-ask-name>
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Subject]" value="Question from the NON site" data-non-ask-subject>

      <label class="visually-hidden" for="non-ask-body">{{ 'sections.somm.ask_body_label' | t }}</label>
      <textarea
        id="non-ask-body"
        class="non-ask__body"
        name="contact[body]"
        rows="7"
        required
        data-non-ask-message></textarea>

      <div class="non-ask__row">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="non-ask-email">{{ 'sections.somm.ask_email' | t }}</label>
        <input
          id="non-ask-email"
          class="non-ask__email"
          type="email"
          name="contact[email]"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          placeholder="{{ 'sections.somm.ask_email' | t | escape }}"
          data-non-ask-email>
        <button type="submit" class="non-ask__send">{{ 'sections.somm.ask_send' | t }}</button>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endform -%}
</div>
